{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28117","headline":"永乐殷尧藩明府县池嘉莲咏 · 雍陶","name":"永乐殷尧藩明府县池嘉莲咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青苹白石匝莲塘，水里莲开带瑞光。\n露湿红芳双朵重，风飘绿蔕一枝长。\n同心栀子徒夸艳，合穗嘉禾岂解香。\n不独丰祥先有应，更宜花县对潘郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}